#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:17 1c1d10fde20f495fbe3c57ce00f89409
msgid "``Filter``、``EQ6``、``EQ10``、``EQ21``"
msgstr "``Filter``, ``EQ6``, ``EQ10``, ``EQ21``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:18 7d7203ede6d94404b4abb26c5219163d
