#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:25 e7e425a454a54737874af25090a7f75a
msgid ""
"表中的名称都以 ``FmodAudioEffect`` 开头，完整接口见 :doc:`../api_reference/dsp`。在检查器中编辑效果资源可使用对应预览；Panner "
"支持拖动，EQ 支持拖动频率和增益、悬停滚轮调节 Q。"
msgstr ""
"All names above have the ``FmodAudioEffect`` prefix; see :doc:`../api_reference/dsp` for full "
"APIs. Edit effect resources in the inspector to use their previews. Panner supports dragging; EQ "
"supports frequency/gain dragging and Q adjustment with the wheel over a band."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:28 71315d7c47b2406a831ceee1eead2e3f
msgid "添加和旁路"
msgstr "Add and bypass effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:30 b7bfb45202b0421aa0c6e841df455de2
msgid "以下示例使用 :doc:`mixer` 中的独立总线模式。为 Music 创建低通配置，将播放器的 Bus 设为 Music："
msgstr ""
"These examples use the independent bus mode described in :doc:`mixer`. Create a low-pass "
"configuration for Music and set the player Bus to Music:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:32 5141226ef4d941cab8df0c13b3a4a93b
msgid ""
"func add_music_filter() -> int:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    if music_id == -1:\n"
"        music_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"    var effect: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"    effect.cutoff_hz = 1200.0\n"
"    return layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, effect)"
msgstr ""
"func add_music_filter() -> int:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    if music_id == -1:\n"
"        music_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"    var effect: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"    effect.cutoff_hz = 1200.0\n"
"    return layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, effect)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:43 ff4f93f1975a44ffbbcb43830e3cc7e0
msgid ""
"返回值是槽位 ID。通过 ``set_bus_effect_enabled(bus_id, slot_id, enabled)`` 控制该槽位，或用 "
"``set_bus_bypass(bus_id, bypass)`` 旁路整条总线的受管效果。暂时关闭效果时保留槽位，可维持 DSP 状态。"
msgstr ""
"The return value is a slot ID. Control it with ``set_bus_effect_enabled(bus_id, slot_id, "
"enabled)``, or bypass the managed effects on a whole bus with ``set_bus_bypass(bus_id, bypass)``."
" Retaining slots when temporarily disabling effects preserves DSP state."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:46 a6bb8c6725d84bc6916ecbea8d34204f
msgid "配置与实时数据"
msgstr "Configuration and live data"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:48 e362729104ff4b189edd7a9c56affa68
msgid ""
"布局保存配置资源，每个槽位拥有独立运行实例。修改配置会同步到实例；Capture 缓冲、频谱和录音从运行实例读取。添加槽位后调用 "
"``flush_bus_updates()``，即可在同一帧获取实例。"
msgstr ""
"Layouts store configuration resources, and each slot owns an independent runtime instance. "
"Configuration edits propagate to instances; read Capture buffers, spectra, and recordings from "
"the runtime instance. Call ``flush_bus_updates()`` after adding a slot to access its instance in "
"the same frame."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:50 8360542f910a4d5b9ea143a003a561f8
msgid "布局切换、槽位删除或效果替换后，应重新获取对应实例。共享配置不会共享各槽位的捕获和分析状态。"
msgstr ""
"Reacquire the instance after switching layouts, deleting slots, or replacing effects. Shared "
"configuration does not share capture or analysis state between slots."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:53 bc64f717891c46cd8b524269ae1f4d5c
msgid "Capture：读取音频帧"
msgstr "Capture: read audio frames"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:55 0a9f073cca574a159ca14cd69a553fec
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    capture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if capture == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var frames: PackedVector2Array = capture.get_buffer(capture.get_frames_available())\n"
"    if not frames.is_empty():\n"
"        print(frames[0])"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    capture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if capture == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var frames: PackedVector2Array = capture.get_buffer(capture.get_frames_available())\n"
"    if not frames.is_empty():\n"
"        print(frames[0])"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:76 3f6cf127eb11422688f48f25ded7685d
msgid "每个 Vector2 的 x、y 分别为左、右采样。读取会消费缓冲帧；缓冲满时丢弃新帧，保留未读帧。``clear_buffer()`` 清空队列并重置计数。"
msgstr ""
"Each Vector2 stores left and right samples in x and y. Reading consumes buffered frames. A full "
"buffer drops incoming frames and keeps unread frames. ``clear_buffer()`` empties the queue and "
"resets counters."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:79 a9495990097a40a7af16b0944d5c9288
msgid "SpectrumAnalyzer：读取频段"
msgstr "SpectrumAnalyzer: read frequency bands"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:81 19dd418366ef41caae95398a9ca984a4
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var analyzer: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.new()\n"
"    settings.fft_size = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.FFT_SIZE_2048\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    analyzer = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if analyzer == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var bass: Vector2 = analyzer.get_magnitude_for_frequency_range(\n"
"        20.0,\n"
"        250.0,\n"
"        FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE,\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(bass)"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var analyzer: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.new()\n"
"    settings.fft_size = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.FFT_SIZE_2048\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    analyzer = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if analyzer == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var bass: Vector2 = analyzer.get_magnitude_for_frequency_range(\n"
"        20.0,\n"
"        250.0,\n"
"        FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE,\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(bass)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:107 be24dcbcd0ed4a178d8dddae4773d44c
msgid "频段查询返回左右声道的线性幅度。同一 DSP 时钟内复用频谱快照，新音频块到来后自动更新。增大 FFT 窗口会提高频率分辨率，并增加时间窗口和计算量。"
msgstr ""
"Frequency queries return linear magnitudes for the left and right channels. Queries reuse a "
"snapshot while the DSP clock is unchanged and refresh it for a new audio block. Larger FFT "
"windows improve frequency resolution while increasing the time window and processing work."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:110 f02fde20018f4302acb6af539e7ff2c2
msgid "Record：导出录音"
msgstr "Record: retrieve a recording"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:112 3ddbd052036948c5a20121229bd8eea4
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var recorder: FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectRecord = FmodAudioEffectRecord.new()\n"
"    settings.format = FmodAudioEffectRecord.FORMAT_16_BITS\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    recorder = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func start_recording() -> void:\n"
"    if recorder != null:\n"
"        recorder.recording_active = true\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_recording() -> AudioStreamWAV:\n"
"    if recorder == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    recorder.recording_active = false\n"
"    return recorder.get_recording()"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var recorder: FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectRecord = FmodAudioEffectRecord.new()\n"
"    settings.format = FmodAudioEffectRecord.FORMAT_16_BITS\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    recorder = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func start_recording() -> void:\n"
"    if recorder != null:\n"
"        recorder.recording_active = true\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_recording() -> AudioStreamWAV:\n"
"    if recorder == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    recorder.recording_active = false\n"
"    return recorder.get_recording()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:139 3bf70bc806384d5c86255c81af0061b0
msgid "``get_recording()`` 返回 AudioStreamWAV，可通过 ``save_to_wav(path)`` 保存。录制会持续积累音频数据；按需要限制时长并及时取出结果。"
msgstr ""
"``get_recording()`` returns an AudioStreamWAV that can be saved with ``save_to_wav(path)``. "
"Recording accumulates audio data; limit duration and retrieve results as needed."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:142 ba8f71a36cd54cd7872f9b50ba458001
msgid "效果顺序与低层 DSP"
msgstr "Effect order and low-level DSP"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:144 a860e60815df4ae9a3cd53377f6dd431
msgid "槽位按布局顺序处理。可从“EQ/滤波 → 压缩 → 失真 → 延迟/混响 → 分析/录音”开始试听，再按目标音色调整；分析器和录音器的位置决定它们读取到的信号。"
msgstr ""
"Slots process in layout order. Start with EQ/filter → compressor → distortion → delay/reverb → "
"analysis/recording and adjust for the intended sound. Analyzer and recorder positions determine "
"the signal they read."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:146 5c4644d9f9c04bdeaa3c442291cfed41
msgid ""
"需要原生参数索引或给单次播放添加处理时，使用 :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` 和 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.add_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_dsp>`。直接创建的 DSP "
"由调用方管理挂接、移除和释放。"
msgstr ""
"Use :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` and "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.add_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_dsp>` for native parameter"
" indices or processing on one playback. The caller manages attachment, removal, and release for "
"directly created DSPs."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:148 2f7de86ffa204838b48dad9425ed0ab9
msgid "频谱分析和音高变换等处理会增加 CPU 开销。运行项目后，在调试器监视器查看 ``FmodCPUUsage``；用相同音频、通道数和采样设置比较调整前后的结果。"
msgstr ""
"Processing such as spectrum analysis and pitch shifting adds CPU work. Run the project and "
"inspect ``FmodCPUUsage`` in the debugger monitors. Compare changes with the same audio, channel "
"count, and sample settings."
